                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> An enemy within 15 feet of the sicklight wisp is sickened</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The sicklight wisp feeds on the creature's illness. The creature takes @Damage[4d10[void]] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:33|basic] save). The wisp regains @Damage[2d10[healing]] Hit Points, and if the sicklight wisp has Gone Dark, their sicklight glow reactivates.</p>"
                },
                "frequency": {
